                                                Element(
                                                    OutlineElement {
                                                        contents: [
                                                            RichText(
                                                                RichText {
                                                                    text: "Action research seeks transformative change through the simultaneous process of taking action and doing research, which are linked together by critical reflection.\u{fddf}HYPERLINK \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kurt_Lewin\"Kurt Lewin, then a professor at \u{fddf}HYPERLINK \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/MIT\"MIT, first coined the term \"action research\" in 1944. In his 1946 paper \"Action Research and Minority Problems\" he described action research as \"a comparative research on the conditions and effects of various forms of social action and research leading to social action\" that uses \"a spiral of steps, each of which is composed of a circle of planning, action and fact-finding about the result of the action\". ",
                                                                    text_run_formatting: [
