                                                            Element(
                                                                OutlineElement {
                                                                    contents: [
                                                                        RichText(
                                                                            RichText {
                                                                                text: "Teacher Research can be any form of research that teachers do, including action research, but not limited to it. At George Mason University, teacher research is described in a way that is very similar to what most authors understand as action research. And at some point, they suggest that action research can be a synonym of teacher research.\u{a0} The description of action research posted on this site is more closely aligned to what we have called reflective practice.\u{a0} \u{a0}This shows the variation in the way that people working in the field have of conceptualizing these terms.",
                                                                                text_run_formatting: [
                                                                                    ParagraphStyling {
                                                                                        charset: None,
                                                                                        bold: false,
